<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    World Book Day: an open book lies under the G with one page turning, and letters float up out of it one after
    another, drifting off to either side of the G and fading away like a story taking flight.

    Every doodle is a 48dp square drawn around the widget's own 24dp G; see doodle_halloween.xml for the layout.
-->
